"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"取图过程中，一直在寻找有没有清晰的蓍草照片，后来，直到我看到了这么一篇报道（原文是网页，打印成pdf留证收录），点击附件阅读"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240806091503-b9v9uk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806091503-b9v9uk9","updated":"20240815115505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"a strong","TextMarkAHref":"assets/蓍草报道-20240806091503-9rqiq0k.pdf","TextMarkTextContent":"蓍草报道.pdf"}]},{"ID":"20240806091807-pmeb985","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806091807-pmeb985","updated":"20240812172757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"关键内容在文档中倒数第三段，这里直接截图出来"}]},{"ID":"20240806091805-n5chfbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806091805-n5chfbn","updated":"20240812172757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240806091805-ukwqxco.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806092050-v2khxbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806092050-v2khxbi","updated":"20240812172757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"连太昊伏羲陵的蓍草都已不是真的蓍草，所以蓍草篇就此结束，虽然还有其他两地有蓍草，但我也没有信心相信那是真的蓍草；"}]},{"ID":"20240806093454-3qp0xe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806093454-3qp0xe7","updated":"20240812172757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"本想既然找不到本草，网络世界这么大，那找一些家里代代‘祖传’下来的蓍草图片也可以，遗憾的是也没能找到，所以收录至此结束。"}]},{"ID":"20240806093415-s5j814d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806093415-s5j814d","updated":"20240812172757"}},{"ID":"20240806084305-5ziqiv6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20240806084305-5ziqiv6","updated":"20240812172933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"b","TextMarkTextContent":"关于蓍草"}]},{"ID":"20240812172849-uq3vf12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240812172849-uq3vf12","updated":"20240812172933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"未找到有说服力的图源，作绝迹处理。"}]},{"ID":"20240806092710-zjknbr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806092710-zjknbr4","updated":"20240806093043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"据说百年蓍草会长到49片叶子，大道五十，天衍四九；"}]},{"ID":"20240806093340-v2oiw6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806093340-v2oiw6u","updated":"20240806093043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"据说蓍草的茎杆形如八卦，有八棱八角；"}]},{"ID":"20240806084315-e62wf9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806084315-e62wf9m","updated":"20240806093043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"‘蓍草丛生紫云拥,龟文落箨占星芒’，相传凡是蓍草能生长的地方，都是祥瑞之地，上空有紫云飘动。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113134-2mhnrfx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607113134-2mhnrfx","updated":"20240806093043"}},{"ID":"20240616113727-y3lmugm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616113727-y3lmugm","updated":"20240616113732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616113727-5i1z8wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113727-5i1z8wy","updated":"20240616113727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113727-hka9p88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113727-hka9p88","updated":"20240616113727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧先知。久服，不饥不老，轻身。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113727-nchiy9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113727-nchiy9j","updated":"20240616113727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：蓍实味苦酸平无毒，主益气，充肌肤，明目聪慧，先知，久服，不饥不老，轻身，生少室山谷，八月九月采实暴干（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113727-tbpl2dp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113727-tbpl2dp","updated":"20240616113727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生少室，八月九月采实，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113727-zofqj0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113727-zofqj0n","updated":"20240616113727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蓍，蒿属，生千岁，三百茎；《史记》龟策《传》云：蓍，百茎共一根。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113931-c38j9ze","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616113931-c38j9ze"}},{"ID":"20240616113932-ixowkm0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616113932-ixowkm0","updated":"20240616113937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616113932-8tmpha6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113932-8tmpha6","updated":"20240616113932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦平。主益气，充肌肤，得天地之和气以生，故亦能益人之正气而强健也。明目，聪慧先知。蓍草神物，揲之能前知。盖得天地之灵气以生，故亦能益人之神明也。久服，不饥，不老轻身。气足神全，故有此效。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113932-eslja9s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113932-eslja9s","updated":"20240616113932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此因其物之所能以益人之能也。昔圣人幽赞于神明而生蓍，此草中之神物也。服之则补人之神，自能聪慧前知，食肉者鄙，不益信夫。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114056-a5o77xx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114056-a5o77xx"}},{"ID":"20240616114057-170uf80","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114057-170uf80","updated":"20240616114103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114057-vbxjytf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114057-vbxjytf","updated":"20240616114100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"蓍实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生少室山谷，今蔡州上蔡县白龟祠旁。其生如蒿，作丛。高五、六尺，一本一、二十茎，至多者三、五十茎，生便条直，所以异于众蒿也。秋后有花，出于枝端，红紫色，形如菊；八月、九月采其实，日干入药。今医家亦稀用。其茎为筮，以问鬼神，知吉凶，故圣人赞之，谓之神物。《史记龟策传》曰∶龟千岁乃游于莲叶之上。蓍百茎共一根。又其所生，兽无虎野狼，虫无毒螫。徐广注曰∶刘向云龟千岁而灵，蓍百年而一本生百茎。又褚先生云∶蓍生满百茎者，其下必有神龟守之，其上常有青云覆之。传曰∶天下和平，王道得，而着茎长丈，其丛生满百茎。方今世取蓍者，不能中古法度，不能得满百茎，长丈者。取八十茎以上，蓍长八尺，即难得也。民众好用卦者，取满六十茎以上，长满六尺者，即可用矣。今蔡州所上者，皆不言如此。然则此类其神物乎？故不常有也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114149-9rjodor","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114149-9rjodor"}},{"ID":"20240616114150-v8kco8h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114150-v8kco8h","updated":"20240616114155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114150-c1w9xc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114150-c1w9xc0","updated":"20240616114150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补中气．"}]},{"ID":"20240616114150-4c8yyxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114150-4c8yyxi","updated":"20240616114150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦酸平．益气充肌．明目．聪慧先知．久服不饥不老．（此神草也、故本经列之上品．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114150-ypr7lbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114150-ypr7lbk","updated":"20240616114150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶治痞疾．（腹中痞块、蓍叶、独蒜、穿山甲末、食盐同好醋、捣成饼、量痞大小贴之、以两炷香为度、其痞化为血、从大便出．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114134-hlyue38","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114134-hlyue38"}},{"ID":"20240616114135-toxoge4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114135-toxoge4","updated":"20240616114139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114135-540v1an","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114135-540v1an","updated":"20240616114135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补中气．"}]},{"ID":"20240616114135-82zneay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114135-82zneay","updated":"20240616114135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦酸平．益气充肌．明目．聪慧先知．久服不饥不老．（此神草也、故本经列之上品．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114135-62ug7xy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114135-62ug7xy","updated":"20240616114135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶治痞疾．（腹中痞块、蓍叶、独蒜、穿山甲末、食盐同好醋、捣成饼、量痞大小贴之、以两炷香为度、其痞化为血、从大便出．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114117-wyq5v7n","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114117-wyq5v7n"}},{"ID":"20240616114118-mk0brg0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114118-mk0brg0","updated":"20240616114130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114118-48ta3vq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114118-48ta3vq","updated":"20240616114118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸，平，无毒。主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧，先知，久服不饥，不老，轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114118-3rxhmib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114118-3rxhmib","updated":"20240616114118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生少室山谷。八月、九月采实，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114250-ecg2qkb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114250-ecg2qkb"}},{"ID":"20240616114251-ux3rjw7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114251-ux3rjw7","updated":"20240616114255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114251-uhygykz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114251-uhygykz","updated":"20240616114251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸，平，无毒。主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧先知。久服不饥、不老、轻身。生少室山谷。八月、九月采实，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114251-k253d1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114251-k253d1h","updated":"20240616114310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此草，所在有之，以其茎为筮。陶误用楮实为之。《本经》云∶“味苦”。楮实味甘,其楮实移在木部也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114228-qah1fy7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114228-qah1fy7"}},{"ID":"20240616114230-6puj2ls","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114230-6puj2ls","updated":"20240616114236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114230-fzi8gyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114230-fzi8gyi","updated":"20240616114230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦酸，平，无毒。主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧先知。久服，不饥、不老、轻少室山谷，八月九月采实，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114230-mdb2xqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114230-mdb2xqg","updated":"20240616114230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"子"}]},{"ID":"20240616114230-njgq5ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114230-njgq5ku","updated":"20240616114230"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，微温，无毒。主五脏瘀血，腹中水气，胪胀留热，风寒湿痹，身体诸痛，疗心下坚，膈中寒热，周痹，妇人月水不通，消食明目。久服轻身，延年不老，驱 食之神仙，生雍州川谷，亦生上党及道边，十月采实，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114218-p61yvnz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114218-p61yvnz"}},{"ID":"20240616114219-ug1rjrw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114219-ug1rjrw","updated":"20240616114224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114219-a78zcxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114219-a78zcxd","updated":"20240616114219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸，平，无毒。主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧先知。久服不饥，不老，轻身。生少室山谷。八月、九月采实，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114219-4ovvlkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114219-4ovvlkc","updated":"20240616114219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶此草所在有之，以其茎为筮。陶误用楮实为之。《本经》云味苦，楮实味甘，其楮实移在木部也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114219-x6nj0eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114219-x6nj0eo","updated":"20240616114219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶蓍实，生少室山谷，今蔡州上蔡县白龟祠旁，其生如蒿作丛，高五、六尺，一本一、二十茎，至多者三、五十茎，生便条直，所以异于众蒿也。秋后有花出于枝端，红紫色，形如菊，八月、九月采其实，日干入药。今医家亦稀用。其茎为筮，以问鬼神知吉凶，故圣人赞之，谓之神物。《史记·龟策传》曰∶龟千岁，乃游于莲叶之上，蓍百茎共一根，又其所生，兽无虎野狼，虫无毒螫。徐广注曰∶刘向云龟千岁而灵，蓍百年而一本生百茎。又褚先生云∶蓍生满百茎者，其下必有神龟守之，其上常有青云覆之。传曰∶天下和平，王道得而着茎长丈，其丛生满百茎。方今世取蓍者，不能中古法度，不能得满百茎长丈者，取八十茎以上，蓍长八尺即难得也。民众好用卦者取满六十茎以上，长满六尺者，即可用矣。今蔡州所上者，皆不言如此。然则此类，其神物乎，故不常有也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114107-ifkjjz8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114107-ifkjjz8"}},{"ID":"20240616114108-7g5wsbm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114108-7g5wsbm","updated":"20240616114113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114108-r53xuna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114108-r53xuna","updated":"20240616114108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦酸性平，益气充饥，久服不饿。蓍叶∶同独蒜、甲片、食盐、米醋捣饼，贴癖两炷癖可化血，从便出。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114043-5p8b71j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114043-5p8b71j"}},{"ID":"20240616114044-xj615nz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-xj615nz","updated":"20240616114048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-6qdx9k7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-6qdx9k7","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-hbp5ejp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-hbp5ejp","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近取诸身，远取诸物。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-mximixb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-mximixb","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦酸，平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-ujbbgs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-ujbbgs6","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主益气，充肌肤明目，聪慧先知，久服不饥，不老延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-9b69b1f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-9b69b1f","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶生少室山谷，及蔡县白龟祠旁。春时宿根再发，端直无枝，末大于本，一本一二十茎，或四五十茎，经百岁者，茎亦百，茎虽多，总一本也。秋后花出茎端，红紫色；"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-x2izmlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-x2izmlq","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实褐色，如艾实。吕氏春秋云∶蓍满百茎，所在之处，兽无虎野狼，虫无蛇螫，其下便有神龟守之，其上常有青云覆之。传云∶天下和平，王道得而蓍茎长丈。又云∶天子蓍长九尺，诸侯七尺，大夫五尺，士庶三尺，设有僭用，便失灵异。埤雅云∶此神草也。亦草中之多寿者也。故蓍从耆。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-erq0r3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-erq0r3k","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶悉一根抽发，原具生生变化之数，而末大于本，所谓知来者逆也。明目者，字从目，即默识精明，条分缕析之征也。聪慧先知者，字从老，即更事久，尽知之征也。气味苦酸平，得木火升出之机，故益气熏肤充肌、根繁余百，行地无疆，故不饥不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-epglg2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-epglg2j","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（神物考云∶蓍，天所生之神物也。其法始于伏羲，今唯文王孔子墓间生之。其茎长丈，一年长寸，百年长丈，自丈后，则不长矣。其丛满百数，止百茎，无多寡也。覆以紫云，守以灵龟，祥瑞之物，气类之感耳。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114044-5d2rwzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114044-5d2rwzr","updated":"20240616114044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（尔雅翼云∶圣人幽赞于神明而生蓍。蓍，草也，初不待圣人而生，盖通天之道，穷物之（易曰∶蓍之德圆而神，卦之德方以智。又云∶神以知来，智以藏往，其孰能与此。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616114021-emy3adk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616114021-emy3adk"}},{"ID":"20240616114022-d6id1bc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114022-d6id1bc","updated":"20240616114027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114022-ut3bn6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114022-ut3bn6c","updated":"20240616114022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实性平酸苦味，开心强志有先知，明目聪耳兼益气，轻身不老亦不饥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616114022-h93uaex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114022-h93uaex","updated":"20240616114022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即蓍草之实，天地间寿考物也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113959-c17onn5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616113959-c17onn5"}},{"ID":"20240616114000-dy4vj7u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616114000-dy4vj7u","updated":"20240616114006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616114000-orsjd2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114000-orsjd2y","updated":"20240616114000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，无毒．生少室．八月、九月采实，晒干．"}]},{"ID":"20240616114000-qh6qnxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616114000-qh6qnxx","updated":"20240616114016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶蓍实，味苦，平．主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧先知．久服，不饥不老轻身，生少室山谷，八月九月采实暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616113943-bdwdcds","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616113943-bdwdcds"}},{"ID":"20240616113944-vn0tgh4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616113944-vn0tgh4","updated":"20240616113954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓍实《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616113944-6nxcyi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616113944-6nxcyi3","updated":"20240616113944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸，平，无毒。主益气，充肌肤，明目，聪慧，先知，久服不饥，不老，轻身。生少室山谷。八月、九月采实，日干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113037-tb0v5fz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607113037-tb0v5fz"}},{"ID":"20240607113037-n5rbm1i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607113037-n5rbm1i","updated":"20240607113132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蔡州耆实《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113037-j0nxmca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113037-j0nxmca","updated":"20240607113102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸，气平。无毒。种生蔡州山谷，（今河南上蔡县。）苗类青蒿作丛。多者三五十茎，高者六七尺许。茎茎条直，自异群蒿。花类菊花淡黄，亦同秋绽；实若楮实深赤，但不味甜。九月采收，曝干待用。明目增智慧，益气充肌肤。久服不饥，轻身耐老。（谟）按∶刘向《说苑》云∶天下和平，圣君在位。其种长丈，一根百茎。下必守以灵龟，上常罩有云雾。满山无毒螫，一方绝虎野狼。茎采类凤尾龙头，卜筮通天根月窟。诚为神物，世所罕稀。今所生者不过出蔡州寻常而已，安能得绝妙之如是耶？"}]},{"ID":"20240607113022-yyvx10m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607113022-yyvx10m"}},{"ID":"20240607113014-xy3xrln","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-xy3xrln","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蓍实"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-bbfa0o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-bbfa0o4","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-ach32zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-ach32zp","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shī Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-pib7pnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-pib7pnc","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-32hma6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-32hma6b","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-6hpujjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-6hpujjg","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-40st4us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-40st4us","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蓍"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"果实"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。9～10月，果熟时采收，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-n1ienix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-n1ienix","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-fsmo5g2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-fsmo5g2","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-tmq6epc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-tmq6epc","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"酸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-yripqbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-yripqbi","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-fdmk2tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-fdmk2tf","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》：\"主益气，充肌肤，明目聪慧。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-is9gvdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-is9gvdr","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-3nb71gw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-3nb71gw","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-8jycj28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-8jycj28","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-dmsm0za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-dmsm0za","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-547khhu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-547khhu","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蓍实"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-5n5dr7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-5n5dr7q","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-38kqgpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-38kqgpr","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Shī Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-k3s3m9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-k3s3m9y","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-xzuo2f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-xzuo2f0","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Fruit of Alpine Yarrow"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-92z991i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-92z991i","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-am01u45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-am01u45","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-ycb3ait","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-ycb3ait","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-7qazebc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-7qazebc","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为菊科植物高山蓍的果实。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-ck7wnxn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-ck7wnxn","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Achillea alpina L."}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-mf3r69y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-mf3r69y","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季果实熟时采收，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-xj1elv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-xj1elv7","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-c8ysz7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-c8ysz7a","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 高山蓍 多年生草本，高50-100cm。具短根状茎。茎直立，有棱条，上部有分枝。叶互生；无柄；叶片长线状披针形，长6-10cm，宽7-15mm，栉齿状羽状深裂或浅裂，裂片线形，排裂稀疏，半抱茎，两面生长柔毛，下面毛密生，有腺点或几无腺点，下部叶花期常枯萎，上部叶渐小。头状花序多数，花径5-6mm，集生成伞房状；总苞钟状，总苞片卵形，3层，覆瓦状排列，绿色，草质，有中肋，边缘膜质，疏生长柔毛；边缘舌状花，雌性，5-11朵，白色，花冠长圆形，先端3浅裂；中心管状花，两性，白色，花药黄色，伸出花冠外面。瘦果扁平，宽倒披针形，有淡色边肋。花期7-9月，果期9-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-mxmsuwt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-mxmsuwt","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-imqjoe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-imqjoe8","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味酸；苦；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-b7ytwqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-b7ytwqk","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-04uog8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-04uog8e","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 益气；明目。主气虚体弱；视物昏花"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-nspdj0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-nspdj0f","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-vjllw4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-vjllw4d","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，5-10g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-90kd65a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-90kd65a","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-xev1kx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-xev1kx4","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》：主益气，充肌肤，明目聪慧。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-47os8gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-47os8gn","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607113014-22d6x8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113014-22d6x8w","updated":"20240607113014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113026-rnzwpsc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607113026-rnzwpsc"}},{"ID":"20240607113027-c9fnn6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113027-c9fnn6h"}}]}